{
  "mappings": [
    {
      "name": "read: any payment of ours, by Notch Pay's reference, reads complete for the charge's 5000 XAF",
      "priority": 10,
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "urlPathPattern": "/payments/trx\\.test_[0-9a-f-]{36}",
        "headers": {
          "X-Grant": {
            "matches": ".+"
          },
          "Authorization": {
            "matches": ".+"
          }
        }
      },
      "response": {
        "status": 202,
        "headers": {
          "Content-Type": "application/json"
        },
        "body": "{\"code\":202,\"status\":\"Accepted\",\"message\":\"Payment retrieved\",\"transaction\":{\"reference\":\"{{request.pathSegments.[1]}}\",\"trxref\":\"{{regexExtract request.path '[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{12}'}}\",\"amount\":5000,\"amounts\":{\"converted\":5000,\"currency\":\"XAF\",\"rate\":1,\"total\":5000},\"currency\":\"XAF\",\"status\":\"complete\"}}"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "why": [
          "The read, addressed by Notch Pay's own reference as the sandbox required (item 2), answering",
          "with the sandbox's shape: transaction (item 15), our reference as trxref, no id, and amounts.total,",
          "which the adapter requires to be the charge's. 202 is openapi.yaml 2.1.0's documented status; the",
          "sandbox answered 200, and the client accepts any 2xx. The amount and currency are the conformance",
          "charge's (ADR-0031 condition 5)."
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "read: Notch Pay has no record (404 Payment not found)",
