      },
      "metadata": {
        "why": "Notch Pay's sandbox read its canceled-by-user number (+237670000004) as canceled on 2026-10-21, the evidence RFC-0012 section 4 named: payer_declined. The public key can also cancel (ADR-0031), so it is evidence of a decline, not proof of whose."
      }
