      "metadata": {
        "why": [
          "REF_SHORT_COLLECTION. Notch Pay's sandbox, 2026-10-21: its insufficient-funds test number (+237670000001)",
          "read complete with amount 107 and amounts.total 105; on every other answer that day total equalled",
          "amount. This is that read's shape (identifiers replaced, amounts scaled to the conformance charge's",
          "5000 XAF). The adapter must answer Malformed, never Succeeded."
        ]
